<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Scorpion Earthmoving - Site Cuts, Pad Prep, Trenching & Clearing | NT</title>
<meta name="description" content="Scorpion Earthmoving NT - site cuts, pad preparation, trenching, land clearing and detailed excavation. Owner-operated, laser-level finish.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Scorpion Earthmoving - NT Earthworks">
<meta property="og:description" content="Site cuts, pad prep, trenching, clearing and detailed excavation across the Top End. Laser-level finish, owner-operated.">
